WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:13.500
This is the BPO client console. It is where a new client engagement begins.

2
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:22.500
The admin opens the new client form. No separate system, no spreadsheet.

3
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:36.500
One click creates the client and generates a secure access code, ready to hand to them.

4
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:48.500
The client signs in with the access code they were given. No separate onboarding call, no shared login.

5
00:00:48.500 --> 00:01:02.500
Their case is already there, with its document attached, created and recorded before they ever logged in.

